Security and no-claim proof for WP10:

Passed by TypeScript/Rust tests:
- launcher-only evidence stays `knownLauncher`;
- launcher foreground stays launcher foreground only;
- launcher-game candidate rows are not known game proof;
- known-game classification requires `childGameEvidenceClaimId` plus
  deterministic or classifier-backed child-game proof state;
- permission-limited launcher metadata keeps zero confidence and explicit
  permission-limited status.

Not claimed:
- no live launcher manifest crawling;
- no private launcher token or account capture;
- no game telemetry payload capture;
- no content, chat, voice, or screen capture;
- no journal ingest or SQLite replay;
- no policy execution;
- no broad blocking.
